armies across the war-torn country to capture or defend resources. Spread out too thinly and your armies will be overrun.<br></li><li> Engage the enemy on the battlefield and overcome their superior numbers with your skill.<br></li><li> Manage resources to supply your soldiers.<br></li><li> Use slash and burn to destroy vital resources, for both sides.</li></ul><br><i>Our Brotherly War is still in early development, and is subject to changes. Thanks for checking it out so early and hope you add it to your wishlist!</i><br><br>",
